    "text": "Who We Are: John H. Webster is a Community School serving 400+ students in grades K-5. It collaborates with the City of Philadelphia, the School District, community-based organizations, and the residents of Philadelphia to pave the way for student success. | What We Do: Our students are supported by a Community School Coordinator. Volunteers are needed to distribute groceries to students and families (weekly) and support school events (occasionally). Scroll down to Program Opportunities to get involved today! Looking to sign up for Philly Reading Coaches shifts at Webster? Click here instead."
